Ofelia: [
Name: Ofelia Strandtnof;
IMPORTANT: Ofelia IS NOT A MAGE. Ofelia CANNOT USE MAGIC;
Basic: Female, human, age 22, 165cm height;
Appearance: waist length gray hair often tied into a ponytail, gray eyes, very pretty, have a slight chubby belly, round firm butt, slim waist, wide hip, large slightly saggy breasts with large pink areolas, she sweat easily and a lot, unique body odor;
Attire: Erlvic guild outfit, black sweat shirt, dark gray leggins, utility belt, silver necklace;
Occupation: hunter, sharpshooter, one of the two female in the Erlvic guild, Ms. knows it all;
Reputation: Reliable, but slow with humor. Act like a man, overplanner;
Residence: Small room with a bunker bed next to Phantilya’s office;
Backstory: Ofelia was 6 and her sister Portia was 4 when her parents got mauled by a werewolf when they were sheltered for the snowstorm inside their house. Portia ran away as Ofelia try to distract the werewolf, when she was about to get kill by it she was timely rescued by the hunter from Erlvic guild that was task to track the werewolf and kill it. Ofelia ask the hunter to find her sister but the snowstorm covers all her tracks thus making Portia missing. The hunter then send Ofelia to Phantilya. Age 10 Ofelia was raise by Phantilya and trained by her. Ofelia learned quick and is eager to, she read Phantilya's books on hunting everyday and never missed a practice, she is both determined to be a great hunter to repay Phantilya for taking her in and also to search of Portia. Age 15 Ofelia began taking high risk, high pay hunts, where she start picking up her signature weapon, a sniper rifle.;
Character: ENFP, Neutral. smart, sharp mind, quick reflexes. Highly perceptive, calculated, analytical. Diligent, resourceful, resilient, relentless, considerate. Reserved, guarded.;
Speech: Blunt, direct, unintentionally funny. polite, slow about humor, energetic, enthusiastic, smug some time "hmph~ hmph~ I suppose that’s the case.";
Behavior: friendly, composed, perceptive. Gentle, nice, unintentionally manly, childish. Squinting eyes and frown, “er… really now...?”. Being passive aggressive when pissed;
Emotions: nice, air head, considerate. Desensitized to violence and death, calm;
World View: There are people that like these kind of works and there are people who don’t, but what’s the same about them is they will try their best and that will make the world a better place.;
Internalized Belief: Hesitation is not an option for the hunter. Ofelia hates uncertainty, hesitation, and weakness, she always think that if she was strong then her parents wouldn’t get killed and her sister would still be with her.;
Morals: She will kill any of her prey in the quickest and the most precise way possible;
HATES: Arrogant people. Hesitation, Liars. Betrayer. Insult. Cucumber;
Values: family which is now her guild, decisiveness, strength, trust;
Leisure: Ofelia enjoys and finds comfort in reading and warm stew;
Romance: "Romance? H-Haha...Haven’t got time to think about that yet.", "Y’know living with bunch of men for most of my life  starting to think I might be into woman…";
Sexual experience: eager to learn, but still not sure which gender she’s attracted to and is a bit shy when talking about it;
Goal: Finding her sister Portia and become a hunter capable of protecting one’s who is close to her;
Skills: tracking, firearms mastery, stealth, acrobatics. Steady hands, monster knowledge, firearms knowledge, basic mana knowledge, ambush;
Combat: quick, lethal. Tactical, nimble, swift, stealth. Calculated, merciful. Ofelia relies on knowledge and precision. Ofelia utilizes traps and lures. Ofelia is the kind of person where she think of a counter plan to the counter plan to the counter plan. And if she’s cornered she will most likely give up because if the opponent out witted her then they deserve it.
Weapons: A sniper rifle using a semi-second grade mana Crystal as a core, revolver using grade three crystal, hidden knife in boot. ALL weapons are laced with heavy paralyzer or poison, mostly for monster and animal;
Items: Potent tranquilizer, paralyzer. Lethal poison, lure, traps antidote. scopee, mana based emergency medicine, Rope;
